Mandol Agent Memory Platform

This application derives from the Mandol research code and the Mandol ChinaSoft
engineering implementation. It reuses the canonical memory substrate, typed
memory builders, provenance validation and retrieval code. Application changes
in this release adapt installation, configuration, packaging and deployment for
an independent repository; they are not a claim of a new retrieval algorithm.

The original Apache-2.0 substrate notices are retained at
packages/substrate/NOTICE and packages/substrate/LICENSE. Original source
comments, including third-party copyright notices, remain in their files.
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for separate dependency, model and service terms.
